{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "UI changed → accessibility pass",
  "description": "Runs the jsx-a11y lint and reviews the change against the accessibility rules (spec 06-accessibility-performance, A11Y-*).",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "src/components/**/*.tsx",
      "src/app/**/*.tsx",
      "src/app/globals.css"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "A UI file changed. 1) Run `npm run lint:a11y` (jsx-a11y recommended rules) and fix every error; an exception needs an eslint-disable comment with the reason, like the scrollable code region in CodeView.tsx. 2) Review the edited file for what lint cannot see: interactive targets at least 44 px (min-h-11 / 44px), icon-only buttons with aria-label, decorative SVG aria-hidden, keyboard reachability and visible focus, any new animation guarded by prefers-reduced-motion (CSS media query or useReducedMotion), text contrast in both night and Daybreak themes. 3) If a dialog was touched, focus must be trapped and Escape must close it. Report what you checked and changed."
  }
}
